airunner (6.1.3-3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix #2250 (clean-container install failed): postinst no longer
    seeds /etc/airunner/daemon.yaml from the doc dir (doc-stripped
    systems such as containers never install it); the seed ships at
    /usr/share/airunner/daemon.yaml and a missing seed warns instead
    of failing the configure step.

 -- Capsize LLC <contact@capsizegames.com>  Fri, 09 Oct 2026 05:30:00 -0600

airunner (6.1.3-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix #2243 (apt package cannot boot):
    - Gap 1: vendor airunner-common 6.1.7 as files (debian/vendor,
      verified against the published wheel) until it ships its own
      Debian binary; the installed daemon no longer dies with
      ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'airunner_common'.
    - Gap 2: the daemon boots without torch in degraded mode: /health
      stays reachable, sidecar-backed modalities keep working, and
      local generation endpoints report missing-runtime diagnostics
      (502/503) instead of exiting. Torch imports in the shared memory
      helpers are now optional and the local STT fallback returns
      failure envelopes instead of raising. The optional desktop
      client bundle mount no longer fails the boot when its
      directory is unreadable by the service user.

 -- Capsize LLC <contact@capsizegames.com>  Fri, 09 Oct 2026 03:46:18 -0600

airunner (6.1.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Services-only apt packaging scaffold (issue #2237). Ships the
    airunner-daemon, airunner-headless and airunner-service console
    scripts plus the airunner-headless systemd unit. No Qt desktop.

 -- Capsize LLC <contact@capsizegames.com>  Thu, 08 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
